# DM26-0670

# infra/config/workloads/cassini-harness.nuon
#
# The load harness (src/agents/cassini/test; docs/architecture/policy-enforcement.md, stage 5a): a producer that
# sends a run's messages and a sink that measures them, each a builder agent with the eight lanes as its topics.
# Neither is deployed as it is rendered: `infra/load-harness.nu` makes a run's Jobs from these rendered Jobs, one per
# producer and per sink, with the run's parameters (HARNESS_*) as environment variables, and reads the result line
# each logs. A target that is measured enables them and applies their `-resources.yaml` (the service accounts, which
# are their identities), never their Jobs.
[
  {
    name: "harness-producer"
    kind: "agent"
    image: "harness-producer"
    config: "document"
  }

  {
    name: "harness-sink"
    kind: "agent"
    image: "harness-sink"
    config: "document"
  }
]
